`png_longjmp` is libpng’s wrapper for `longjmp`. Use it instead of calling `longjmp(png_ptr->jmpbuf, val)` directly. If `longjmp_fn` and `jmp_buf_ptr` are set, it jumps there; otherwise it aborts the process. It must not return.
