    Sets the stored location for an unknown chunk in `info_ptr`. Use it only for a valid chunk index after `png_set_unknown_chunks`. If location lacks IHDR/PLTE/AFTER_IDAT, it reports an error and coerces to IHDR or AFTER_IDAT behavior. Its signature is:
    ```cpp
    
PNG_EXPORT(175, void, png_set_unknown_chunk_location,
