    `png_set_bKGD` stores a PNG bKGD chunk value in `info_ptr`. Call it with valid `png_ptr`, `info_ptr`, and `background`; it copies the color into `info_ptr->background` and marks `PNG_INFO_bKGD` valid. If any arg is NULL, it does nothing. Its signature is:
