    `png_get_oFFs` retrieves the image offset metadata (`oFFs` chunk). Call it with valid `png_ptr`, `info_ptr`, and non-NULL output pointers; it fills x/y offsets and unit type, returning `PNG_INFO_oFFs` if present, else 0. Its signature is:
