    ```
20. `png_set_strip_alpha`
    `png_set_strip_alpha` enables the `PNG_STRIP_ALPHA` transform. Call it on a valid `png_structrp` before reading rows to drop any alpha channel. If read transforms are no longer allowed (`png_rtran_ok` fails), it does nothing. Its signature is:
