2. `png_set_crc_action`
​ `png_set_crc_action` sets how libpng handles CRC errors in critical and ancillary chunks. Call it on a valid `png_ptr` before reading. Critical chunks can be kept or cause error; discarding critical data is invalid and warns.
​ Its signature is:
