6. `png_free_default`
​ `png_free_default` is libpng’s default deallocator. Use it to free memory previously allocated by libpng’s default allocator. If `png_ptr` or `ptr` is `NULL`, it returns immediately; otherwise it calls `free(ptr)`. Deprecated.
