PNG_EXPORT(39, void, png_set_filler, (png_structrp png_ptr, png_uint_32 filler, int flags));
​ ```

5. `png_set_palette_to_rgb`
​ `png_set_palette_to_rgb` requests libpng to expand paletted images to full RGB, and also expand tRNS transparency if present. Call it before reading image rows. If transformations are already locked out, it does nothing; otherwise it sets `PNG_EXPAND | PNG_EXPAND_tRNS`.
​ Its signature is:
​ ```cpp
PNG_EXPORT(28, void, png_set_palette_to_rgb, (png_structrp png_ptr));
​ ```

6. `png_set_swap`
​ `png_set_swap` enables byte-swapping for 16-bit PNG data. Call it on a valid `png_ptr`; if `bit_depth == 16`, it sets `PNG_SWAP_BYTES`. If `png_ptr` is NULL or depth isn’t 16, it does nothing.
​ Its signature is:
​ ```cpp
