4. `png_set_mem_fn`
​ `png_set_mem_fn` lets you replace libpng’s default alloc/free with your own. Call it on a valid `png_structrp` before allocations; it stores `mem_ptr`, `malloc_fn`, and `free_fn`. If `png_ptr` is `NULL`, it does nothing.
