​ Destroys a write-side libpng state. Call with pointers to `png_struct*` and optional `png_info*`; it frees associated info, then the write struct, and sets `*png_ptr_ptr` to NULL. If `png_ptr_ptr` or `*png_ptr_ptr` is NULL, it does nothing.
