​ ```

4. `png_set_eXIf_1`
​ Stores EXIF data for an eXIf chunk in `info_ptr`. Call with valid `png_ptr/info_ptr`; it frees any existing EXIF, allocates `num_exif` bytes, copies `exif`, and on NULL ptrs returns. If alloc fails, warns and leaves no data.
​ Its signature is:
​ ```cpp
