​ ```

5. `png_set_text`
​ `png_set_text` stores `num_text` text entries into `info_ptr` via `png_set_text_2`. Use it after valid `png_ptr`/`info_ptr` are set. If memory allocation fails, it raises `png_error("Insufficient memory to store text")`.
