​ ```

6. `png_get_text`
​ `png_get_text` retrieves text chunks from `info_ptr` and returns their count. Use it with valid `png_ptr`/`info_ptr`; if `text_ptr`/`num_text` are non-NULL, they’re filled in. If no text or args are NULL, it returns 0 and sets `*num_text` to 0 when provided.
