​ ```

5. `png_set_oFFs`
​ Sets the PNG oFFs chunk: stores image x/y offsets and unit type in `info_ptr`, marking `PNG_INFO_oFFs` valid. Call with non-NULL `png_ptr`/`info_ptr`; if either is NULL, it returns with no effect.
